A command whose unreferenced helper carries a record naming DS1701, a code about a
dependency row. A record for a dependency kind marks nothing live and can match no
finding about a function, so helper is reported and the record is stale.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

//deadset:ignore DS1701 -- kept for the loader
func helper() {}
